{
  "rationale": "Plant G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion capability, capturing how sensor outcomes (uncontrollable) and motion commands (controllable) interact. The specification automata E1-E4 enforce safe, progress-oriented exploration: E1 binds clear perception to forward/random_walk actions; E2-E3 enforce conservative, directed obstacle recovery; E4 ensures full_rotate is only used as a last resort after repeated blockages. All transitions are deterministic, and recovery actions are brief and only escalate as needed.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model plant as a combined perception-motion automaton to ensure correct sequencing of uncontrollable sensor events and controllable motion actions.",
    "Decompose specification into modular automata: one for exploration progress, one each for left/right/front obstacle recovery, and one for escalation to full_rotate only after repeated failures."
